                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b4fb2f2b-e8cf-338e-b5f1-742b96366bcd",
                        "entry_id": "94856dd0-9c66-3671-96c8-35da4623c4d6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., юр. чистый бланк, подписанный лицом, предоставляющим другому лицу право заполнить его текстом по своему усмотрению"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "69b7db34-d1aa-307f-bd5f-115121a8110a",
                        "entry_id": "94856dd0-9c66-3671-96c8-35da4623c4d6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. полная свобода действий, неограниченные полномочия, предоставленные кому-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "25360143-cbdf-45c0-b44e-26e07baa6e4f",
                                "sense_id": "69b7db34-d1aa-307f-bd5f-115121a8110a",
                                "text": "В нача́ле го́да но́вому гла́вному тре́неру «Уралана» Игорю Шалимову был дан по́лный карт-бла́нш, пра́вда, в разу́мных преде́лах — поря́дка 8 миллио́нов до́лларов."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a0ae745-fe75-4cc6-a262-4c69ca13d4d1",
                                "sense_id": "69b7db34-d1aa-307f-bd5f-115121a8110a",
                                "text": "Мне очень важно знать ваше мнение, ибо Верховный дал мне карт-бланш вплоть до расстрела этого господина."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "24987b4f-ad54-3c9a-a0b8-da621e8db817",
                        "entry_id": "94856dd0-9c66-3671-96c8-35da4623c4d6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "карт. комбинация в некоторых карточных играх (пикет, гинг, безик и др.) — расклад, в котором нет фигурных карт (карт-картинок)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f4a5a06-4dde-4f1a-bf20-a43378aba19b",
                                "sense_id": "24987b4f-ad54-3c9a-a0b8-da621e8db817",
                                "text": "— Там лучше: пикетная игра требует большого внимания, а здесь Надежда Васильевна начнет разговаривать с Александром Михайловичем о своем Карамзине, пойдут споры, заслушаешься, снесешь четырнадцать, пропустишь карт-бланш… Нет, право, Алексей Семенович, сядемте лучше там!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c594c3c9-2425-465d-97cb-76394634ea15",
                        "source_entry_id": "94856dd0-9c66-3671-96c8-35da4623c4d6",
                        "target_lang_word": "carte blanche",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "carte blanche",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bfaa7f0-a2ed-327f-9184-2e47a33d74b5",
                                        "entry_id": "e11f1c61-7caa-3e00-ada6-783a10d9244b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unlimited discretionary power to act; unrestricted authority."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46d32dc0-d4aa-44ff-8fca-db20cdef4cf6",
                                                "sense_id": "9bfaa7f0-a2ed-327f-9184-2e47a33d74b5",
                                                "text": "“[…] But since when did army officers afford the luxury of amanuenses in this simple republic ?[…]Does your carte blanche run so far as that also ?”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6d11d06-d9c4-418e-8f74-77fc38728f67",
                                                "sense_id": "9bfaa7f0-a2ed-327f-9184-2e47a33d74b5",
                                                "text": "We have given technology carte blanche, much in the way Congress has always, in the past, given automatic approval to defense budgets, resulting in the most gigantic graft in history."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3544c46d-0a57-4a14-b1b6-2a51cf1b00ea",
                                                "sense_id": "9bfaa7f0-a2ed-327f-9184-2e47a33d74b5",
                                                "text": "Baron Cohen and director Larry Charles have indeed retreated with The Dictator, but they’ve gone back 80 years, when the Marx Brothers were given carte blanche at Paramount Pictures with a five-movie run that ended with their best movie, 1933’s Duck Soup."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f63edb1-2078-4d82-a42e-9078abe2418b",
                                                "sense_id": "9bfaa7f0-a2ed-327f-9184-2e47a33d74b5",
                                                "text": "Somewhat unsurprisingly, unleashing the most powerful navy on the planet with carte blanche to exterminate slavers on sight saw a dramatic and sudden collapse in slaver numbers in the late 1840s and early 1850s."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f29c66c-cb91-4965-816f-86d82649fdfc",
                                                "sense_id": "9bfaa7f0-a2ed-327f-9184-2e47a33d74b5",
                                                "text": "That’s especially the case since the Supreme Court issued a ruling last year that provides a former president with immunity from criminal prosecution for all “official acts” taken while in office. Trump and MAGA world interpret this, and not without cause, as giving them carte blanche."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e68bbcd-5f30-32c5-91f1-e70b3f565697",
                                        "entry_id": "e11f1c61-7caa-3e00-ada6-783a10d9244b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A blank paper that is signed by some authority and given to a person to fill as they please."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c3e0e50-0b7a-412a-81dd-eb9d7a1b0955",
                                                "sense_id": "6e68bbcd-5f30-32c5-91f1-e70b3f565697",
                                                "text": "2001, Oliver Sacks, Uncle Tungsten: Memories of a Chemical Boyhood, Alfred A. Knopf (2001), 15,\nIndeed, I later learned that when they had bought the place, in 1930, they had given my father's older sister Lina their checkbook, carte blanche, saying, \"Do what you want, get what you want.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "139385be-c7c8-3bec-9d86-9b2f5a0661d8",
                                        "entry_id": "e11f1c61-7caa-3e00-ada6-783a10d9244b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hand with no court cards."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f395d972-a77b-3825-a5fc-7ab267c39b81",
                                        "entry_id": "e11f1c61-7caa-3e00-ada6-783a10d9244b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chargecard issued by Diners Club International."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "carte blanche",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a347827-cb3e-3951-a954-993c0bd45f24",
                                        "entry_id": "3ac6cf2f-33e4-327d-aef8-d8f2d7fba445",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "As an undifferentiated mass, without regard to distinctions; willy-nilly. (Possibly from confusion with another French phrase, en masse.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b52ff857-cef2-4d6a-a413-adccc185c18e",
                                                "sense_id": "4a347827-cb3e-3951-a954-993c0bd45f24",
                                                "text": "Can gay and lesbian people in justice be excluded carte blanche from the sacrament of sexual love sharing, let alone from church membership or leadership?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f38c1ca-d007-4fae-b4b3-eed1a7522043",
                                                "sense_id": "4a347827-cb3e-3951-a954-993c0bd45f24",
                                                "text": "The mass production of tennis equipment made it more affordable, such that blue-collar workers were no longer excluded carte blanche as before the war (Birley 1995b)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e2acd34-a120-4cd9-ac59-09123f181eaf",
                        "source_entry_id": "94856dd0-9c66-3671-96c8-35da4623c4d6",
                        "target_lang_word": "carta blanca",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
